# .well-known directory

Place your .well-known files here. They'll be accessible at:
https://lukelittle.com/.well-known/

Examples:
- static/.well-known/atproto-did → https://lukelittle.com/.well-known/atproto-did
- static/.well-known/security.txt → https://lukelittle.com/.well-known/security.txt
- static/.well-known/apple-app-site-association → etc.

Hugo copies everything in static/ to the root of your site.
